# apis/, docs/, infrastructure/, and qa-tools/ should only ever contain
# git submodules (see .gitmodules). Ignore everything else under them so
# that untracked files/dirs from individual repos - or a new repo dropped
# in without being registered as a submodule - never get swept into the
# metarepo by an `add .` run from the root.
apis/*
docs/*
infrastructure/*
qa-tools/*
